    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trump jigsaw is puzzle jigsaw game with puzzles and images from president Trump and his era. This is a logical game in which the goal of the game is to rearrange the tiles to get the final picture. Puzzle game contains 8 images and can you be the lawnmower genious and solve all jigsaw puzzles <br>Different sized jigsaws, so be the hero and solve all jigsaws and collect steam achievements</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features of the game:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- 8 jigsaws for now <br>- Steam achievements<br>- Different sized jigsaw images</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buttons:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mouse to move jigsaws<br>- R = Restart game<br>- Escape= quit game</p>",
